  "goodToKnow": "Das Szenario is a scenario: ein mögliches Szenario, das Worst-Case-Szenario. German spells it with Sz, pronounced sts, like die Szene (scene). The plural is usually die Szenarien, though Szenarios is also accepted. In climate science and economics, Szenarien are model projections. It came via Italian scenario, originally a plan of the scenes in a play. It's neuter."
